<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Worldcom started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Worldcom started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- JP Morgan said analyst Simon Flannery initiated coverage of WorldCom Inc as market performer.</p>
<p>-- estimated profit of $0.20 per share for 1997, and profit $0.47 for 1998, compared to a loss $0.01 in 1996.</p>
<p>-- set price target of $28 for the end of this year. Shares fell 1/16 to 23-1/4.</p>
</text>
